	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h2 style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: #e8e8e8;">Chris Barrus</span></h2>
<h3 style="text-align: left;">Head of Business Intelligence</h3>

		</div> 
	</div> 
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  text-white">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: left;"><img decoding="async" class=" wp-image-217 alignright" src="https://coda.globalliquidi1.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/01/team-chris.jpg" alt="" width="188" height="188" srcset="https://codamarkets.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/01/team-chris.jpg 300w, https://codamarkets.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/01/team-chris-150x150.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 188px) 100vw, 188px" /></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Chris joined the electronic trading industry in 2018 at SpeedRoute LLC, where he developed expertise in custom smart routing strategies and trading economics. In early 2025, he transitioned to CODA Markets to focus on enhancing routing decisions and optimizing trading costs. He earned a degree in Finance from the University of Central Florida and was a member of the tennis team. Outside of work, Chris enjoys golfing, playing tennis, and spending time with his family. He holds FINRA Series 7, 57, and 66 licenses.</p>

		</div> 
	</div> </div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><!-- Row Backgrounds --><div class="upb_grad" data-grad="background: -webkit-gradient(linear, left top, left bottom, color-stop(0%, #E3E3E3), color-stop(47%, #E3E3E3));background: -moz-linear-gradient(top,#E3E3E3 0%,#E3E3E3 47%);background: -webkit-linear-gradient(top,#E3E3E3 0%,#E3E3E3 47%);background: -o-linear-gradient(top,#E3E3E3 0%,#E3E3E3 47%);background: -ms-linear-gradient(top,#E3E3E3 0%,#E3E3E3 47%);background: linear-gradient(top,#E3E3E3 0%,#E3E3E3 47%);" data-bg-override="0" data-upb-overlay-color="" data-upb-bg-animation="" data-fadeout="" data-fadeout-percentage="30" data-parallax-content="" data-parallax-content-sense="30" data-row-effect-mobile-disable="true" data-img-parallax-mobile-disable="true" data-rtl="false"  data-custom-vc-row=""  data-vc="9.0.1"  data-is_old_vc=""  data-theme-support=""   data-overlay="false" data-overlay-color="" data-overlay-pattern="" data-overlay-pattern-opacity="" data-overlay-pattern-size=""    ></div>
